        "source": "BibleProject",
        "audioUrl": "https://afp-597195-injected.calisto.simplecastaudio.com/695767b0-cd40-4e6c-ac8c-ac6bc0df77ee/episodes/e377fa21-f15c-4ec8-b498-507f52e60c14/audio/128/default.mp3?awCollectionId=695767b0-cd40-4e6c-ac8c-ac6bc0df77ee&awEpisodeId=e377fa21-f15c-4ec8-b498-507f52e60c14",
        "durationSec": 2671,
        "adInsertionDrift": false
      },
      {
        "recordId": "ask-nt-wright:podcast:901a0482-com-79e0bee1-9b9a-365b-8796-2f8d34debedf",
        "startSec": 903,
        "endSec": 1145,
        "why": "This gives a complementary perspective on the word itself. N.T. Wright says the in-between state may be called “paradise,” a place to be “rested and refreshed,” but cautions that “heaven’s not the end of the world”; the conversation also pictures believers as conscious of the unfinished world and longing for justice.",
        "episodeTitle": "#145 Should I use the word ’heaven’? Will we know everything in the new creation?",
        "sourceId": "ask-nt-wright",
        "source": "Ask NT Wright Anything",
        "audioUrl": "https://traffic.megaphone.fm/NSR4942893507.mp3?updated=1749722680",
        "durationSec": 1514,
        "adInsertionDrift": true
      },
      {
        "recordId": "radically-christian:podcast:9e7dc54f-https-radicallychristian-com-p-10783",
        "startSec": 773,
        "endSec": 939,
        "why": "End with the destination Scripture’s larger storyline points toward. The speaker describes the “city of God and earth” being reunited, with evil, pain, and suffering gone, and calls the garden-city picture at the beginning and end of the Bible “the very best picture” of the hope Christians can expect.",
        "episodeTitle": "What is Heaven Like?",
        "sourceId": "radically-christian",
        "source": "Radically Christian",
        "audioUrl": "https://substackcdn.com/video_upload/post/148682126/4e272d8d-5c1b-4e59-9dae-556c2af50d54/transcoded.mp3?post_id=148682126&relation=podcast&Expires=1785437765&Key-Pair-Id=APKAIVDA3NPSMPSPESQQ&Signature=CB~Mrrk9eeMkE4ipBz~rK1KfES1FawtJ0u2Qks-AOxgJPzJDjDG0~~mt5Nefm7ATUWRFycvCbZJQhkWGd-2uXoasMv6A01qLNyj6T73kJYUF2HBNo6H5dOMD1daht4J4npCgXdEbeiqmCSUG8KLmGJpeDoRCmENItDQIVyOSm7V~OY2F3MOuU7cH3HEPcjdxIdyRSLOLsnqXHc7EfEpKavS0rAS93UOkE0L2je2Ce0fHwJunqFyrE9izFw3wSE-NiZDgotbgb9rjOSD4PO-6wAyWLPMi01oOxsmk~yRehlw6jmSV9ID~54Nd2wWoAegbhkqd-uQQXYdA7QxyGu42cw__",
        "durationSec": 3894,
        "adInsertionDrift": false
      }
