    "closing": "Taken together, these clips ask you to hold two truths without confusing them: believers may be with Christ after death, yet the Bible’s fullest hope is bodily resurrection and a renewed creation. Heaven is not less than God’s presence; it is more than the popular image of floating away—it is the story moving toward God dwelling with his people and making all things new.",
